WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.689
Hello we are SciToons at Brown University.

00:00:03.689 --> 00:00:06.420
Through collaboration between

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:09.120
students and professors, scientists and

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.150
artists, we use animation to make science

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.370
compelling and accessible to broader

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.070
audiences. Find us on the social media

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.660
platforms.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:25.010
We'd love to share our work with you.

